    "long_instructions": "## **Add New Task**\r\n\r\nWhen the user clicks **Add New Task**, a new task should be added to the **end** of the list.\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Use AI to help you write a function called `addNewTask`.\r\n   \r\n2. In the function, use `.push()` to:\r\n    - add the title to `titleArray`\r\n    - add the details to `detailArray`\r\n    - add `false` to `isPriorityArray`\r\n   \r\n3. Call `renderTasks()` as the last line of the `addNewTask` function.\r\n\r\n4. Use your function as the event handler for the **Add New Task** button."
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 12:33:10 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 12:33:13 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 12:37:05 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"require_edit_to_continue\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 12:37:37 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"start_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 12:41:47 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 12:54:17 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"encrypted_exemplar_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:03:57 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"encrypted_exemplar_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:04:03 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"encrypted_exemplar_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:06:07 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"encrypted_exemplar_sources\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:18:07 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:19:44 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:21:49 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-30 13:23:59 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"long_instructions\"],\"changed_by_id\":22366,\"changed_by_email\":\"joi.anderson@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-04-